@slug school-registration
@title School Registration Form
@intro All fields are mandatory. You can save your progress and come back later before submitting.
## School Information
School Name* | text
Management Name* | text
School Logo* | file
School Motto* | text
Year Established* | year
School Type* | radio | Private; Government; Government-Aided; International; Trust; Society
School Category* | checkbox | Pre School; Regular School; Alternate School; Inclusive School; Special School
Affiliated Boards* | checkbox | CBSE; ICSE; State Board; IB; IGCSE; Other
Affiliation Number* | text
## School Statistics
Total Students* | number
Teaching Staff* | number
Non-Teaching Staff* | number
Campus Area* | text
Number of Campuses* | number
If more than 1 campus, do you want to list the other campus/campuses on our platform too?* | yesno
Annual Fee Range (per annum)* | text
Admission Fee* | text
Transport Available* | yesno
Hostel Available* | yesno
School Timings* | text
Student–Teacher Ratio* | text
Co-ed / Boys / Girls* | radio | Co-ed; Boys; Girls
Inclusive Education Support* | yesno
Scholarships Available* | text
## Academics
Curriculum Highlights* | textarea
