Grades Offered* | checkbox | $GRADES
Medium of Instruction* | checkbox | $MEDIUM
Languages Offered* | checkbox | $LANGS23
## Facilities, Sports & Activities
Facilities* | checkbox | $SCHOOL_FAC
Sports & Activities* | checkbox | $SPORTS
